113:   dropped it from its conclusion. Closing it is cheap -- one cell whose tile entry is programmed
114:   outside the 0x8001..0x8005 range -- and it is OWED.
115: * **`mode & 1` is clause-(e) debt by the same test that saved M28**: the unread bits flow into
116:   NOTHING the guarded body reads. That is the `mode & COPY` shape the ruling names explicitly.
117: * **`x & 1` and `y & 2` are within-class value slices.** They are not closable by any finite row
118:   set -- for any cells you drive, a predicate false on exactly those cells exists -- which is
